    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin helps you find images without alt text and update them in bulk.</p>\n<p>It suggests alt text based on image filenames and allows manual editing.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to /wp-content/plugins/</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the WordPress admin</li>\n<li>Go to &#8220;Alt Text Editor&#8221; in the admin menu</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20overwrite%20existing%20alt%20text%3F\">\nDoes it overwrite existing alt text?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, it only shows images without alt text.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
